    "created_at": "2024-01-15T12:28:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-15T12:29:59Z",
    "body": "I wonder if we want an arbitrary extension point for this or just call into Trusted Types directly. With an arbitrary extension point we have the risk of running into ordering issues so we tend to avoid those these days, even though the DOM has some precedent for it (mainly historical).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
